      "title": "‘This is state violence’: Paris students rage at politicians and heavy-handed policing",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/06/french-student-protests-barricades-paris-police",
      "description": "<p>Unprecedented protests that began in low-income suburb are turning ugly, with investigations under way into police brutality</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/06/europe-french-school-protests-paris-germany-afd-bulgaria-drones-russia-ukraine-latest-news-updates\">Europe live: latest updates from protests in France</a></p></li></ul><p>Before dawn on Tuesday outside the Lycée Sophie-Germain in central Paris, hundreds of teenagers dragged wheelie bins, metal barriers and shopping trolleys to build a barricade outside the front door of their secondary school.</p><p>Climbing to the top of the piles of bins, pupils held banners calling for more funding and greater equality in French schools.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/06/french-student-protests-barricades-paris-police\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-06T16:23:12"
    },
    {
      "title": "State parliament elects Germany’s first far-right speaker since second world war",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/06/germany-afd-first-far-right-tobias-rausch-speaker-since-war",
      "description": "<p>Tobias Rausch secures role of president in Saxony-Anhalt after AfD’s election breakthrough</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/06/europe-french-school-protests-paris-germany-afd-bulgaria-drones-russia-ukraine-latest-news-updates\">Europe live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>Alternative für Deutschland has become Germany’s first far-right party to secure the position of speaker of a regional parliament since the second world war.</p><p>Tobias Rausch, a former estate agent, was elected in the first round of voting on Tuesday in Saxony-Anhalt. He won 48 out of the 82 votes cast.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/06/germany-afd-first-far-right-tobias-rausch-speaker-since-war\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-06T15:38:58"
    },
    {
